# Build-time settings (Workers Builds → Settings → Build → Variables, or a local .env).
# Absolute origin of the deployed site, no trailing slash. Drives canonical, hreflang,
# sitemap, robots and JSON-LD URLs. Until ticket G: the workers.dev URL.
SITE_URL=
# "true" only on the production domain (ticket G). Anything else renders noindex.
SITE_INDEXABLE=
